'data.frame':	554 obs. of  5 variables:
     [exec]  $ Date       : chr  "05/05/2009" "05/06/2009"
"05/06/2009" "05/07/2009" ...
     [exec]  $ PatientName: chr  "FOO" "BAR" "BAZ" "BUZ" ...
