Hi:

Following
http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/browse_thread/thread/7583b95989b68815/dca9d582ea495d2a?lnk=gst&q=text+one+facet#dca9d582ea495d2a

create a data frame with the coordinates, panel and text label, and then use geom_text():

dfann <- data.frame(x = -0.5, y = 0.2, sitio = 'a', labl = 'This point')

p + geom_point() + theme_bw() + facet_wrap(~sitio, scales="free") +

      geom_text(data = dfann, aes(label = labl))

HTH,
Dennis

